  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young people empowering themselves the employment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will strengthen the personal, labor, and social development of 20 young people in vulnerable situations in Mexico who are in search of employment. We will provide a comprehensive training program that allows the generation of socio-labor, technological and administrative skills necessary for this new century, allowing young people to strengthen their confidence and increase the possibilities of joining a dignified and well-paid job.</narrative>
  </description>
